    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Each limited partner shall pay to the Fund Manager a one-off payment of 5% of such limited partner&rsquo;s paid-up capital contribution over the term of the Fund as management fee, subject to waiver by the Fund Manager at its own discretion.</FONT></TD></TR>
