    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Distributable funds of the Fund will be applied first towards return of each limited partner&rsquo;s paid-up capital contribution, and thereafter 85% to the relevant limited partner and the remaining 15% to the General Partner, provided that the General Partner may waive, in whole or in part, its entitlement to such remaining distribution in respect of any limited partner. Distributions shall be made within 60 days in principle after the Fund receives the relevant income. Unused capital contributions shall be distributed to the partners based on the actual unused amount of their respective paid-up capital contribution.</FONT></TD></TR>
