    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: left"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>Fund Term:</B></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Seven years from the First Closing Date, extendable by the General Partner for up to two consecutive periods of not more than one year each. Following such extensions, the Fund term may be further extended with the proposal of the General Partner and the approval of the partners&rsquo; meeting.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
