    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: left"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>Investment Period:</B></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Four years from the First Closing Date. The period from the expiration of the investment period to the expiration of the term of the Fund (including any extension thereof) shall be the exit period.</FONT></TD></TR>
