    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The Fund shall not engage in any investment activities prohibited by applicable laws and regulations or by regulatory authorities with competent jurisdiction.</FONT></TD></TR>
